[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0010","text":"真乃！\n灯织、巡！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0020","text":"制作人……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0030","text":"——新的工作定下来了！\n……这是详细内容，能读一下吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0040","text":"——！\n这个，这位导演——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0050","text":"——啊。指名要illumination STARS\n……之前的演唱会，她来看了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0060","text":"没告诉你们抱歉！\n但我想让她看到没有背负多余压力的你们——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0070","text":"然后──果然，你们的想法传达到了哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0080","text":"是吗……\n……至少，有一点点传达到了吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0090","text":"——嗯！\n因为她又想和我们一起工作了嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0100","text":"偶像也会拼命努力的这件事，\n她是不是明白了呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0110","text":"——……人，\n不会那么轻易就改变想法的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0120","text":"……我想，这次的“不只是可爱的illumination STARS”\n大概是及格了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0130","text":"——我们……\n就是这样，在每次相遇中不断更新自己"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0140","text":"“那时候就够了”这种事是不存在的，\n为了让对方明白这一点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0150","text":"——是啊……！\n我们来证明……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0160","text":"比昨天更闪耀，到了明天再更加闪耀的话\n偶像就会变得更棒——这件事！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0170","text":"是啊……\n……嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0180","text":"——好！\n既然决定了，练习也要更加努力才行呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0190","text":"──是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_99_0200","text":"──今天是个灿烂的晴天呢"}]
